# Open in VS Code and click "Send Request" (REST Client extension).
# Local run (dotnet run): http://localhost:5401   Through Traefik: http://localhost:8000
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### Health (checks SQL Server AND MinIO)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/health

### List all documents
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents

### Documents of order 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents?orderId=1

### Upload a small text file for order 1 (multipart form)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=LabBoundary

--LabBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="orderId"

1
--LabBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="note.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Delivery note for order 1
--LabBoundary--

### Download document 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/1/download

### Delete document 1 (removes the MinIO object and the SQL row)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/1
